5f9422:timer','i:1781112319;',1781112319),('menu-api-cache-cdb05eda750bc25dc446f5e1b8e278be','i:1;',1781112579),('menu-api-cache-cdb05eda750bc25dc446f5e1b8e278be:timer','i:1781112579;',1781112579),('menu-api-cache-db8350c60ddc0914238ca55608b4076b','i:1;',1780917011),('menu-api-cache-db8350c60ddc0914238ca55608b4076b:timer','i:1780917011;',1780917011),('menu-api-cache-deepseek:b31dd27ac31d0adab53f9cfc149c3942f7ab0a9f','a:1:{s:5:\"reply\";s:915:\"Here are some of the most popular dishes at Alpha:\n\n**Appetizers:** Our **Loaded Nachos** (8.50) are a guest favorite – loaded with cheddar, jalapeños, salsa, guacamole, and sour cream. Also, the **Chicken Wings** (8.50) with buffalo sauce and garlic butter are a classic choice.\n\n**Burgers:** The **Classic Beef Burger** (10.50) is always a hit, but if you like a kick, the **Spicy Jalapeño Burger** (12.50) is excellent.\n\n**Pasta:** The **Chicken Alfredo Pasta** (14.00) is creamy and rich, while the **Shrimp Arrabbiata** (12.00) offers a nice spicy tomato kick.\n\n**Pizza:** Our **Margherita Pizza** (10.50) is simple and fresh, and the **BBQ Chicken Pizza** (15.50) from our Specialty Pizza menu is very popular.\n\n**Desserts:** The **Chocolate Lava Cake** (8.50) and **Brownie Sundae** (6.50) are both decadent choices.\n\nWould you like me to recommend a full meal or tell you more about any of these dishes?\";}',1781122952),('menu-api-cache-fcm:v1:oauth-token:c41e1a491d4e5ba5094e7a0db31b0fb690bc21d9','s:1024:\"ya29.c.c0AZ4bNpbHxgXVrJVAq2nS1_yEoGDzMIqRnZM4RGXe6eM-fvhW8jwOB4NObTfJzm16udi16GoLbcEvAo5FRpPyVJbmeWnwnD5oKGjSLK7jdeQWj-qnUFxW4kHF0buwuXu8XrxCz1k8_0Mcazfn-KxzT57bCeAT2NN345SK7sOKYU6RZ4ULOr7PbJNFbOfJtQgzK6ocLCa39HyDkmUmfCgHtfG9Ijc3gYaP884cN66XBmNb7J38CxZiONkSNRnTHpjKQuaXU86gMLe2tKkfriJdh-LckMjShLQhGCsXpApum3h_33i_qfgUgLMz3WRR40bkp-eNh-EAsJMlFlI0KnISSgZlJ2fGheJ-7LScYtMEVpC7k-eTrJmlAxoT384Cm9ImOqqSxod3lIqU4wz9bzysJs0bF8X1t8ciUxiRiMeot8aBlgS7SzRd5qSjOp1nRQVhgpfZ99YSbJwo-I1g3jy9BQ_zi1Iwsay3MvSVqlpBhp-m5njdeVSrmlV29b5p7-eaMJ