INSERT INTO `chat_messages` VALUES (1,1,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-07 19:09:30','2026-06-07 19:09:30'),(2,1,'user','What is the price of your services',NULL,'2026-06-07 19:09:31','2026-06-07 19:09:31'),(3,1,'assistant','Great question! The pricing for Rozer depends on a few factors, like which features you need (e.g., QR menu, guest ordering, kitchen screen, inventory, analytics), the size of your restaurant, and your setup requirements.\n\nI don\'t have exact price lists here, but the Rozer team can provide a custom quote tailored to your business.\n\nWould you like me to have them contact you? If so, just share your name, phone number, or email, and I\'ll forward your request.',NULL,'2026-06-07 19:09:33','2026-06-07 19:09:33'),(4,1,'user','I cant create a dish give me steps to create the dish',NULL,'2026-06-07 19:11:30','2026-06-07 19:11:30'),(5,1,'assistant','No problem! I can guide you through the basic steps to create a dish in the Rozer system. Here’s a simple step-by-step:\n\n1. **Log in** to your Rozer dashboard.\n2. Go to the **Menu** or **Dishes** section.\n3. Click **Add New Dish** or the **+** button.\n4. Enter the **dish name** (e.g., \"Margherita Pizza\").\n5. Add a **description** (optional, but helpful for guests).\n6. Set the **price**.\n7. Choose a **category** (e.g., Appetizers, Mains, Desserts).\n8. Optionally, upload a **photo** of the dish.\n9. Assign **ingredients** if you use inventory tracking.\n10. Click **Save** or **Publish**.\n\nIf you\'re having trouble or need help with a specific step, just let me know! I can also forward your request to the Rozer team for more detailed support. Would you like me to do that?',NULL,'2026-06-07 19:11:33','2026-06-07 19:11:33'),(6,2,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-07 20:09:39','2026-06-07 20:09:39'),(7,2,'user','Contact human',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:09:39','2026-06-07 20:09:39'),(8,2,'assistant','Of course! I can forward your request to the Rozer team so a real person can get in touch with you.\n\nTo help them reach you quickly, could you please share:\n\n- Your name\n- Your phone number or email\n- Your business type (e.g., restaurant, cafe, bar, etc.)\n- What you need help with (demo, pricing, support, etc.)\n- Your preferred contact method (phone or email)\n\nNo pressure — just whatever you\'re comfortable sharing. The team will contact you soon!',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:09:41','2026-06-07 20:09:41'),(9,2,'user','71251044',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:09:49','2026-06-07 20:09:49'),(10,2,'assistant','Thank you! I have noted your phone number: **71251044**.\n\nTo help the Rozer team assist you better, could you also share:\n\n- Your **name**\n- Your **business type** (e.g., restaurant, cafe, bar, etc.)\n- What you need help with (demo, pricing, support, etc.)\n\nNo pressure — just whatever you\'re comfortable sharing. The Rozer team will contact you soon at the number you provided.',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:09:51','2026-06-07 20:09:51'),(11,2,'user','Raed',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:10:53','2026-06-07 20:10:53'),(12,2,'assistant','Thanks, Raed!\n\nJust to make sure the Rozer team can help you best, could you let me know:\n\n- What type of business do you run? (e.g., restaurant, cafe, bar, etc.)\n- What are you looking for? (e.g., demo, pricing, support, general info)\n\nNo rush — just share what you\'re comfortable with. The team will contact you at **71251044** soon!',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:10:55','2026-06-07 20:10:55'),(13,2,'user','Hotel',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:10:58','2026-06-07 20:10:58'),(14,2,'assistant','Great, thanks Raed! So you\'re running a **hotel**.\n\nTo help the Rozer team prepare the best information for you, could you let me know what you\'re looking for? For example:\n\n- A **demo** of the system\n- **Pricing** details\n- **Support** or setup help\n- General information\n\nJust let me know, and I\'ll make sure the team is ready when they contact you at **71251044**.',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:11:00','2026-06-07 20:11:00'),(15,3,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-07 20:29:18','2026-06-07 20:29:18'),(16,3,'user','Samir',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:29:18','2026-06-07 20:29:18'),(17,3,'assistant','Nice to meet you, Samir! I\'m Rozer.\n\nHow can I help you today? Are you interested in learning more about Rozer\'s digital restaurant system, or would you like to get in touch with our team?',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:29:20','2026-06-07 20:29:20'),(18,3,'user','71251044 raed.ghanim.2014@gmail.com restaurant',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:30:03','2026-06-07 20:30:03'),(19,3,'assistant','Thanks, Samir! Let me note that down:\n\n- **Name:** Samir\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed.ghanim.2014@gmail.com\n- **Business type:** Restaurant\n\nCould you let me know what you\'re looking for specifically? For example:\n- QR menu and guest ordering\n- Staff order management\n- Inventory and kitchen screen\n- Pricing or a demo\n- Something else\n\nThis will help the Rozer team prepare the right information for you.',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:30:05','2026-06-07 20:30:05'),(20,4,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-07 20:35:52','2026-06-07 20:35:52'),(21,4,'user','Omar 71123456 eamil@test.com restaurant after 10 am',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:35:53','2026-06-07 20:35:53'),(22,4,'assistant','Thanks, Omar! I\'ve noted your details:\n\n- **Name:** Omar\n- **Phone:** 71123456\n- **Email:** eamil@test.com\n- **Business type:** Restaurant\n- **Preferred contact time:** After 10 am\n\nThe Rozer team will reach out to you soon. Have a great day!',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:35:55','2026-06-07 20:35:55'),(23,5,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-07 20:41:07','2026-06-07 20:41:07'),(24,5,'user','Raed 03075412 cafe at 12 pm',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:41:07','2026-06-07 20:41:07'),(25,5,'assistant','Hi Raed! Thank you for reaching out.\n\nI understand you\'d like to be contacted at **12 PM** regarding your **cafe**. Just to confirm, is the number **03075412** the best way to reach you?\n\nAlso, could you please share your **email address** and a brief idea of what you need help with (e.g., QR menu, ordering system, etc.)? I\'ll make sure the Rozer team has everything ready for your call.',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:41:10','2026-06-07 20:41:10'),(26,5,'user','Yes',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:42:38','2026-06-07 20:42:38'),(27,5,'assistant','Great, thank you Raed!\n\nI\'ll forward your request to the Rozer team. They will contact you at **03075412** at **12 PM** regarding your **cafe**.\n\nCould you also please share your **email address** so we can send you any relevant information beforehand?',NULL,'2026-06-07 20:42:40','2026-06-07 20:42:40'),(28,6,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:50:24','2026-06-08 06:50:24'),(29,6,'user','71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 7 AM',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:50:25','2026-06-08 06:50:25'),(30,6,'assistant','Thank you, Raed! I\'ve noted your details:\n\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed@rouf.io\n- **Contact time:** 7 AM\n\nCould you also let me know what kind of business you run and what you\'re looking for from Rozer (e.g., QR menu, online ordering, inventory, etc.)? This will help the team prepare the best solution for you.',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:50:27','2026-06-08 06:50:27'),(31,7,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:51:38','2026-06-08 06:51:38'),(32,7,'user','what prices do you have?',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:51:38','2026-06-08 06:51:38'),(33,7,'assistant','Hi there! I\'m Rozer, your friendly AI contact assistant.\n\nThanks for asking about pricing. Since every restaurant is different, our pricing depends on the specific features you need, the size of your restaurant, and your setup requirements.\n\nI can\'t give you exact numbers right now, but if you\'d like, I can collect a few details and have the Rozer team reach out with a custom quote.\n\nCould you share your name, phone number or email, and a bit about your restaurant?',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:51:41','2026-06-08 06:51:41'),(34,7,'user','71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 1 AM whatsapp hotel',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:52:25','2026-06-08 06:52:25'),(35,7,'assistant','Hi Raed! Thank you for sharing your details.\n\nI\'ve noted the following:\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed@rouf.io\n- **Business Type:** Hotel\n- **Preferred Contact Method:** WhatsApp (at 1 AM)\n\nI\'ll make sure the Rozer team gets this information and contacts you via WhatsApp as requested.\n\nThank you for your interest in Rozer! The team will be in touch soon.',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:52:27','2026-06-08 06:52:27'),(36,8,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:53:13','2026-06-08 06:53:13'),(37,8,'user','71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 7 AM',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:13','2026-06-08 06:53:13'),(38,8,'assistant','Thanks, Raed! I\'ve noted your name, phone number (71251044), and email (raed@rouf.io). I\'ll forward this to the Rozer team, and they\'ll get in touch with you soon. Is there anything else you\'d like to ask about our smart restaurant system before they reach out?',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:15','2026-06-08 06:53:15'),(39,9,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:53:46','2026-06-08 06:53:46'),(40,9,'user','hi',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:47','2026-06-08 06:53:47'),(41,9,'assistant','Hello! I\'m Rozer, your friendly AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot here to help you connect with the Rozer team.\n\nHow can I assist you today? Are you interested in learning about our smart digital restaurant system, or do you have a specific question?',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:48','2026-06-08 06:53:48'),(42,9,'user','hi',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:52','2026-06-08 06:53:52'),(43,9,'assistant','Hi again! 😊\n\nI\'m Rozer, your AI assistant bot. How can I help you today? Are you looking for info on our QR menu, guest ordering, or other restaurant features?',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:53:53','2026-06-08 06:53:53'),(44,10,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:55:10','2026-06-08 06:55:10'),(45,10,'user','test',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:55:11','2026-06-08 06:55:11'),(46,10,'assistant','Hello! I\'m Rozer, your friendly AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot here to help you.\n\nIt looks like you sent \"test\" — is there anything specific you\'d like to know about Rozer\'s digital restaurant system? I can answer questions about QR menus, guest ordering, kitchen screens, inventory, and more.\n\nOr, if you\'d like the Rozer team to contact you, just let me know!',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:55:13','2026-06-08 06:55:13'),(47,11,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 06:55:35','2026-06-08 06:55:35'),(48,11,'user','71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 7 AM',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:55:36','2026-06-08 06:55:36'),(49,11,'assistant','Thanks, Raed! I have your details:\n\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed@rouf.io\n- **Contact time:** 7 AM\n\nCould you also let me know what type of business you run and what you\'re looking for from Rozer? That way I can make sure the team has all the context when they reach out to you.',NULL,'2026-06-08 06:55:38','2026-06-08 06:55:38'),(50,2,'user','raed.ghanim.2014@gmail.com raed hotel',NULL,'2026-06-08 07:33:55','2026-06-08 07:33:55'),(51,2,'assistant','Perfect, thank you Raed! Let me summarize what I have:\n\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Business:** Hotel\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed.ghanim.2014@gmail.com\n\nThe Rozer team will contact you soon at the number or email you provided. Is there anything specific you\'d like them to prepare for you — like a demo, pricing, or support for your hotel?',NULL,'2026-06-08 07:33:57','2026-06-08 07:33:57'),(52,2,'user','What does this system provide',NULL,'2026-06-08 09:53:44','2026-06-08 09:53:44'),(53,2,'assistant','Great question, Raed! Rozer is a **smart digital restaurant system**, but it can also work well for hotels with dining services. Here\'s what it provides:\n\n- **QR Menu** – Guests scan to view your menu\n- **Guest Ordering** – Self-ordering from their phones\n- **Staff Order Management** – Track orders in real-time\n- **Chef Kitchen Screen** – Orders sent directly to the kitchen\n- **Accounting & Invoices** – Automated billing\n- **Inventory & Ingredients** – Track stock levels\n- **Stock History** – See usage over time\n- **Analytics** – Sales and performance reports\n- **Modern Customer Experience** – Faster service, less waiting\n\nWould you like the Rozer team to contact you with more details tailored for your hotel?',NULL,'2026-06-08 09:53:48','2026-06-08 09:53:48'),(54,2,'user','What about the pricing?',NULL,'2026-06-08 09:54:08','2026-06-08 09:54:08'),(55,2,'assistant','Thanks for asking, Raed!\n\nPricing for Rozer depends on a few factors, such as:\n\n- The **features** you need (e.g., QR menu, kitchen screen, inventory, etc.)\n- The **size** of your hotel or restaurant\n- Your **setup requirements**\n\nSince every business is different, I don\'t have exact prices to share right now. However, the Rozer team can provide a custom quote based on your needs.\n\nWould you like me to have them prepare a pricing proposal for your hotel? They\'ll reach out to you at **71251044** or **raed.ghanim.2014@gmail.com**.',NULL,'2026-06-08 09:54:11','2026-06-08 09:54:11'),(56,11,'user','raed 71251044 red@test.com',NULL,'2026-06-08 10:42:02','2026-06-08 10:42:02'),(57,11,'assistant','Thanks, Raed! I see you\'ve shared your details again:\n\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** red@test.com\n\nCould you confirm which email is correct: **raed@rouf.io** or **red@test.com**? Also, could you let me know what type of business you have and what you\'re looking for from Rozer? That way the team can prepare the best information for you.',NULL,'2026-06-08 10:42:04','2026-06-08 10:42:04'),(58,12,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 10:54:42','2026-06-08 10:54:42'),(59,12,'user','readtest2 raed@test.com',NULL,'2026-06-08 10:54:43','2026-06-08 10:54:43'),(60,12,'assistant','Thanks, **readtest2**! I\'ve noted your email as **raed@test.com**.\n\nJust to confirm—are you interested in learning more about Rozer\'s digital restaurant system (QR menu, guest ordering, kitchen screen, inventory, etc.)? Also, could you let me know your business type and preferred contact method? That way, the Rozer team can reach out with the right info.',NULL,'2026-06-08 10:54:45','2026-06-08 10:54:45'),(61,13,'assistant','Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?','{\"type\": \"welcome\"}','2026-06-08 11:09:11','2026-06-08 11:09:11'),(62,13,'user','zaher alpha@beta.com',NULL,'2026-06-08 11:09:12','2026-06-08 11:09:12'),(63,13,'assistant','Thanks, Zaher! I\'ve noted your email: alpha@beta.com.\n\nTo help the Rozer team get back to you with the right information, could you tell me a bit more?\n\n- What type of business do you run? (e.g., restaurant, café, food truck, etc.)\n- What are you looking for? (e.g., pricing, demo, support, general info)\n- Any preferred contact method? (email is fine, or would you like to add a phone number?)',NULL,'2026-06-08 11:09:14','2026-06-08 11:09:14'),(64,2,'user','Hello Raed .. I have a cafe want more info about ur service .. 10 items on my menu',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:25:15','2026-06-10 17:25:15'),(65,2,'assistant','Hello! Thank you for reaching out.\n\nFor a **cafe with 10 menu items**, Rozer is a great fit. Here\'s what we typically recommend for a small cafe setup:\n\n- **QR Menu** – Guests scan to see your 10 items\n- **Guest Ordering** – They order directly from their phones\n- **Staff Order Management** – You receive orders on a tablet or phone\n- **Chef Kitchen Screen** – Orders appear in the kitchen (if you have one)\n- **Basic Accounting & Invoices** – Track sales easily\n- **Simple Analytics** – See what\'s selling best\n\nIt\'s quick to set up and very affordable for smaller menus.\n\nWould you like to share your **name**, **phone number**, or **email** so the Rozer team can contact you with more details and a custom quote?',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:25:18','2026-06-10 17:25:18'),(66,2,'user','Explain more about the staff',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:25:43','2026-06-10 17:25:43'),(67,2,'assistant','Sure! Here\'s how the **Staff Order Management** feature works for your cafe:\n\n- **Order Alerts** – When a guest places an order from their phone, staff receive a real-time notification on a tablet or POS screen.\n- **Order Tracking** – Staff can see all active orders, their status (new, preparing, ready, served), and which table or guest placed them.\n- **Modify Orders** – Staff can add notes, modify items, or cancel orders if needed.\n- **Payment Handling** – Staff can process payments directly through the system (cash or card).\n- **Table Management** – Assign orders to specific tables or guest names for easy service.\n\nFor a small cafe with 10 items, this means **faster service**, **fewer mistakes**, and **less running around**. Your team can focus on making great coffee and serving customers.\n\nWould you like the Rozer team to explain more or set up a demo for your cafe? If so, please share your **name**, **phone**, or **email** so they can reach you.',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:25:47','2026-06-10 17:25:47'),(68,2,'user','Rym Wazir',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:26:20','2026-06-10 17:26:20'),(69,2,'assistant','Nice to meet you, Rym!\n\nThank you for your interest. Could you please share your **phone number** and/or **email address** so the Rozer team can contact you with more details and a custom quote for your cafe?',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:26:21','2026-06-10 17:26:21'),(70,2,'user','76134650',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:26:36','2026-06-10 17:26:36'),(71,2,'assistant','Thank you, Rym!\n\nI\'ve noted your phone number: **76134650**.\n\nThe Rozer team will contact you soon to discuss how we can set up the system for your cafe with 10 menu items. They\'ll explain everything about staff management, QR ordering, and pricing tailored to your needs.\n\nHave a great day, and we look forward to helping your cafe run smoothly! 😊',NULL,'2026-06-10 17:26:38','2026-06-10 17:26:38');
