1044\n- **Email:** raed@rouf.io\n- **Contact time:** 7 AM\n\nCould you also let me know what kind of business you run and what you\'re looking for from Rozer (e.g., QR...','/contact-us','new','2026-06-08 06:50:27','2026-06-08 06:50:27'),(4,7,NULL,'raed@rouf.io',NULL,NULL,'whatsapp','71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 1 AM whatsapp hotel','assistant: Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?\nuser: what prices do you have?\nassistant: Hi there! I\'m Rozer, your friendly AI contact assistant.\n\nThanks for asking about pricing. Since every restaurant is different, our pricing depends on the specific features you need, the size of your restaurant, and your setup requirements....\nuser: 71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 1 AM whatsapp hotel\nassistant: Hi Raed! Thank you for sharing your details.\n\nI\'ve noted the following:\n- **Name:** Raed\n- **Phone:** 71251044\n- **Email:** raed@rouf.io\n- **Business Type:** Hotel\n- **Preferred Contact Method:** WhatsApp (at 1 AM)\n\nI\'ll make sure the Rozer...','/contact-us','new','2026-06-08 06:52:27','2026-06-08 06:52:27'),(5,8,NULL,'raed@rouf.io',NULL,NULL,NULL,'71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 7 AM','assistant: Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help you quickly. Are you looking for support, pricing, a demo, or general contact information?\nuser: 71251044 raed raed@rouf.io at 7 AM\nassistant: Thanks, Raed! I\'ve noted your name, phone number (71251044), and email (raed@rouf.io). I\'ll forward this to the Rozer team, and they\'ll get in touch with you soon. Is there anything else you\'d like to ask about our smart restaurant system b...','/contact-us','new','2026-06-08 06:53:15','2026-06-08 06:53:15'),(6,11,NULL,'red@test.com',NULL,NULL,NULL,'raed 71251044 red@test.com','assistant: Hi, I\'m Rozer, your AI contact assistant. I\'m a bot, but I\'ll do my best to help